      <p>The bottom line: you can live comfortably in Spain on €1,500–€2,000/month as a single person. In major cities, budget €2,200–€3,000/month. In smaller, less touristy cities, €1,200–€1,600/month is realistic. These figures assume modest but pleasant lifestyle with occasional dining out, entertainment, and travel.</p>

